    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Geomancer 6, Advantageous Terrain geomancy trick</p><p>Once per day, after a geomancer and her allies roll initiative, the geomancer with this trick can arrange her and her allies' initiative rolls any way she wishes. If she has already taken 3 rounds to scout out the terrain with her advantageous terrain ability and both she and her allies are within the effect area, they gain a +2 bonus to initiative checks. Using this ability is not an action.</p>",
